 "structural_change": "r7w (TW7-KVD2D 10-19) = r7v (CLOSED 1b609a25c TT +13.55 / FF +7.68, reviewed geometry 83ff32c7) re-hardened at the MU release seam TXDP: qkd_d2d_static #(.NTX(3), .TXDP(32'h03030415 = 50529301)) = d2d_cal_image.svh D2D_TXDP_K [21,4,3,3] (MU-DQ-TXDP / COORD 0ki; KV MU GEN2 claude/mu-die-kv2-1019 219049242 compiles K0 21; K0 24 fails the netlisted pair co-sim). Only the TXDP parameter changes (port-0 TX capture 24 -> 21 flops): outline 475.2x280.8, pins, macros, recipe 4 flop-first pins, hold_budget die, io_hold_margin 0.030, CTS 20/40, MEG guards 2.4/1.2 identical to r7v. Benches run the KV end at the die TXDP: KDLY=18 (calendar --txd-k 19,2,1,1 + pinreg 2 -> [21,4,3,3] = 0x03030415). 0 cycles beyond the compiled TXDP.",
