  "cell": "qkd_d2d_static",
  "fix": "re-harden the KV d2d end at the MU release seam TXDP (port 0 capture 24 -> 21 flops); r7v (0x03030418) cannot bind the MU KV die (d2ds_view_select FAILs closed on TXDP mismatch)",
